    # Parcel 
        - Dev Build (First parcel will create dev build for your)
        - Local server (Parcel will create a local server for us, host your app to server)
        - HMR => Hot Module Replacement (It will refresh the page automatically when you save).
        - File Watching Algorithm - written in C++ (Parcel follow file watching algorithm).
        - Caching - Faster builds (When we save file, it will automatically build in less time).All builds will create in .parcel-cache folder.
        - Image Optimazation (Parcel also does image optimization in browser).
        - Minification (If we build in production, Parcel will also do file minification).
        - Bundling (Parcel will do bundling our all the files).
        - Compress (Parcel wil also do compress the file).
        - Consistent Hashing (Parcel also does consistent hashing)
        - Code splittin (Parcel will split your file code).
        - Differential Bundling - support older browsers as well as different different browsers.
        - Error Handling - Parcel will give us good error suggestion.
        - Diagnostics - Parcel displays diagnostics(error or warning) in your terminal and browser.
        - HTTPs - Also host on https.
        - Tree Shaking - remove unused code.

        => For more information about parcel    =>       Go to parceljs.org website. 
    
    - npx parcel build index.html => using this command dist folder will create which contains optimized file for production.

